  "assessment_outcome": "temporarily_unfit",
  "explanation": "The patient has a verified finding of diplopia present within 20 degrees of central fixation. According to the supplied guideline evidence, this specific condition explicitly excludes eligibility for both unconditional and conditional commercial licences. Although the nurse note mentions 'non-physiological' diplopia, the verified fact `vision.diplopia.physiological = false` confirms it is not physiological. The presence of non-physiological diplopia within the specified angular range constitutes an established restriction requiring stopping driving pending investigation or recovery. Other modules (BP, Snellen acuity, visual field, hearing, diabetes, blackout) do not override this established vision-based restriction.",
